---
// Interim notice. Replaced by the full UK GDPR privacy policy when the quote form and analytics are added.
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Eclipse Shield Ltd handles your personal information."
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy policy"
  intro="Draft: last updated October 2026."
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This website is run by {site.legalName} ("we", "us"), a window film company based in {site.base}, registered in {site.registeredIn} with company number {site.companyNumber}. You can contact us
    at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What this website collects</h2>
  <p>
    At the moment this website does not use analytics or advertising cookies, and it has no online forms. If you email
    or call us, we use the details you give us (such as your name, contact details, address and photos of your windows)
    only to answer your enquiry, prepare a quote and carry out any work you ask us to do.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our website host, Cloudflare, processes basic technical data such as IP addresses to deliver the site and protect it
    from attacks.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us for a copy of the information we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, by emailing
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office
    (<a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/">ico.org.uk</a>).
  </p>

  <p>
    <em>A full privacy policy covering the quote form, analytics and cookie choices will replace this page before those
      features go live.</em>
  </p>
</PageLayout>
